/-!
# Route I `CompactInstance`: the three compact square certificates and the `ord`/`near` fields

Plan row C4, instance side. Imports only `CompactCap` (generic consumers) and `KronSquare` (packed
checker). No `CapSource` instance exists in Lean yet, so every statement is parametric in
`S : CapSource`; the source-to-polynomial bounds `hf` are the NAMED hypotheses `PosHf`, `NegHf`,
`NearHf` (exact shape of the `hf` argument of `CompactCap.ord_le_margin`/`nearCap_of_square`),
and the source numerics are hypotheses of `near_cap`.

## What is proved here (all unconditional)

* Three exact `SquareIdentity` instances (`pos_identity`, `neg_identity`, `near_identity`), via
  `(by decide +kernel : KronSquare K p q [] r D cap eps).squareIdentity`, with
  `cap = -9783/10000`, common denominator `D = 2^93 * 5^4` and `eps` the audited total tail of
  the polynomial majorant (`routei-selection/retry/compact-global-{positive,negative}.json`,
  `near-global.json`, last trial). The square witnesses and majorant coefficients are the
  pinned generator outputs, re-expressed over `D`; the remainder `r` is recomputed exactly for
  the retargeted cap.
* `hm` (`l1 r.tail < r.headD 0`) for each, and the margins
  `near >= 187/10000`, `pos >= 7/10^5`, `neg >= 3/10^3` (`margin r D`).

## What is conditional

* `PosHf S t`, `NegHf S t`, `NearHf S t`: the polynomial-majorant bound of the source field
  (source to polynomial). Not proved: needs a `CapSource` instance and the gas (BV/Fourier),
  S13-radial and log-series transfer lemmas (see `C4I-CLAUDE-NOTES.md`).
* Near also needs `strength <= 1/10`, `curvature <= 1/10`, `auxMass pos <= 37/100`,
  `auxTail t pos <= 1/100` (`near_cap`).

## Output

`ord_caps`: `S.OrdCap t sigma (-9783/10000)` for both signs; `near_cap`:
`S.NearCap t (-997/1000)` (`= -9783/10000 - 187/10000`). `compact_caps_384` is the conjunction at
`Trunc.finite 384`, the `ord` and `near` fields of `CapFields.CapBundle`.

kcost: Kronecker, per instance, 1.4 to 1.9 s measured; three `kmul` of 128 x 128 digits at `K <= 210` bits (packed
operands about 27 kbit, `decT` depth 8, about 600 digit comparisons), plus about 2200 list steps
for the guards, the three `smulZ`/`addZ` passes and the coefficient comparison. Measured
(standalone, 6 Nov): kernel 1.4 s, 1.9 s, 1.7 s for the three `*_kron` theorems, 5.3 s kernel for
the whole module, elaboration 1.7 s. The only bulk literals are the 3 x (129 + 128 + 135..255)
integers above.

The generic seed lemmas (`strength_curvature_le`, `q_le`, `auxTail_pos_le`) reduce `hs`, `hc`,
`hE` of `CompactCap.nearCap_of_square` to `1/10 <= eps <= 3/20` and `hM` to a gas-mass bound.
-/

